      "text": "Flow: A → B → C (or D1 / D2) → About you → Your business → Home address → Identity check → connect bank (out of scope). Press Play on A: the simulator recalculates, B routes by state, time and deposits. Steps 3–5 have “Finish later”: progress is saved and the email link resumes the application (dialog designed on step 3). Long lists (state, country) are type-to-filter comboboxes; date of birth has a calendar; all fields are required unless marked optional."
